  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Yemen Women Catalysing on Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, &#x201c;Empowering Yemen Women Catalysing on Renewable Energy&#x201d; aims at promoting innovative solutions for spreading the application and use of solar energy and enhancing engagement of women in small solar businesses. Vulnerable women and women-headed households will be supported to develop and manage solar businesses enabling sustainable income generation as well contribute to recovery and maintenance of social delivery services.</narrative>
  </description>
